{"id":"49047c938f7aef20","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-compactness.md","title":"有效紧致性与可计算孤立路径","display":"thm-effective-compactness — 有效紧致性与可计算孤立路径","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-compactness","aliases":["20-thm-effective-compactness"],"display":"thm-effective-compactness — 有效紧致性与可计算孤立路径","chapter":"8","section":"8.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 8.5.1(i),(ii),(iv)","source_pdf_pages":[202,203],"source_printed_pages":[169,170],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-extendible]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-thm-konig]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-compactness — 有效紧致性与可计算孤立路径"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.5.1(i),(ii),(iv)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span><span>203</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span><span>170</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为可计算树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span> 是任意长可延伸节点集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}[2^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{ext}}]\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;],\\\\\nX\\in[T]\\land\\exists\\sigma\\preceq X\\ ([T_\\sigma]=\\{X\\})\n\\Rightarrow X\\le_T\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}[2^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{ext}}]\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;],\\\\\nX\\in[T]\\land\\exists\\sigma\\preceq X\\ ([T_\\sigma]=\\{X\\})\n\\Rightarrow X\\le_T\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\notin T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge|\\sigma|\\ \\forall\\tau\\in2^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\tau\\notin T].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\notin T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge|\\sigma|\\ \\forall\\tau\\in2^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\tau\\notin T].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个内层检验有限可判定，故不可延伸串的代码形成 c.e. 集，且指标由树指标统一取得；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 判定其成员。若当前前缀可延伸，两子节点至少一个可延伸，优先选 0，否则选 1，就得一条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 可计算路径。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 隔离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 作为固定有限常数写入程序。从已知 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\preceq X\">\\(\\tau\\preceq X\\)</span> 同时搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau0,\\tau1\">\\(\\tau0,\\tau1\\)</span> 的有限空层；唯一路径保证恰有一边不可延伸，因此总能排除错误的一边，得到普通可计算的下一位。此结论对每个隔离路径成立，不要求从树指标统一决定哪条路径被隔离或寻找隔离前缀。有限非空路径类的各点均可用柱分开，故各点可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.5.1(i),(ii),(iv)；印刷 169–170 / PDF 202–203。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"[T]\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}[2^{<\\omega}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{ext}}]\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists X\\in[T]\\ [X\\le_T\\varnothing'],\\\\\nX\\in[T]\\land\\exists\\sigma\\preceq X\\ ([T_\\sigma]=\\{X\\})\n\\Rightarrow X\\le_T\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\notin T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge|\\sigma|\\ \\forall\\tau\\in2^n\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\tau\\notin T].","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\preceq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau0,\\tau1","display":false}],"bytes":2253,"backlinks":[{"id":"77b50faea085ff34","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-hyp]]。"},{"id":"e98d69d59488c0ae","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：